// Gnumeric's native document engine owns imported .gnumeric workbooks.
// Its public C ABI is loaded on demand; the editor and headless driver stay
// Ziran. Keeping the native document retains styles, names, arrays, charts,
// print settings and shared expressions through edits, saves and undo.
NativeArray :: struct { data: **void; count: u32; }
NativePosition :: struct { col: s32; row: s32; }

